{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0d3a06a3836cb1b0e91682ebad586123c392f0a3c4d1472cafeecf5a82990d0e", "ja": "（アイドルサマーフェスティバルが終わった。\nみんなにとって、いい経験になったはずだ！）", "zh": "（偶像夏日祭结束了。\n这对大家而言应该是不错的经验！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "d542b87b8c199d5b977a52079c3a1350c7ee9a56d26a626faf18506cc23e4364", "ja": "お、お疲れさまでした、{$P$}さん。\nふぅ……劇場に、帰ってきましたね……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，你辛苦了。\n呼……终于回到剧场了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "aa67c239d2110af9873507f0522efb9afdd5352f6d20dcf4e80c1506620b4637", "ja": "くんくん……劇場の匂い、落ち着くなぁ……♪\nほんの数日なのに、なんだか久しぶりに感じます……。", "zh": "（嗅嗅）……剧场的味道让人感到平静……♪\n明明才没几天，但感觉好像过了很久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3239deb6d28c4b306771cbbed8fa6a79973afd4910b91764ec106404d32664ba", "ja": "はは。\n可憐がこの劇場に、だいぶ馴染んできた証拠かな？", "zh": "哈哈，\n这应该是代表可怜已经习惯这个剧场了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "a47209a2d4e1cd779eb33b8ad6b121ae3b3ee40ef41ab3880d80086bd482bdf0", "ja": "そうかもしれません……えへへ……♪\nあ、あの……{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "或许是呢……嘿嘿……♪\n那、那个……{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "f3a144d655ad6409a3ad115f036c8a6c791130936facfcc7323824a172b39de4", "ja": "アイドルサマーフェスティバル、どうでしたか……？\nわ、私……ちゃんと笑顔で、歌えてましたか……？", "zh": "偶像夏日祭，你觉得怎么样……？\n我、我……唱歌时有好好微笑吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1006_p", "source_sha256": "054125cb81f1061c2cae5bbee038a86dbc1ab3dbc34ea5131c9701ff9132b4c7", "ja": "もちろん。可憐はいつも華があるけど……\n今回は、迫力みたいなものも感じたな。", "zh": "当然有。虽然可怜平时的表现就很亮眼……\n但这次让人感到格外有气势呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "ddb1e6dc0b131fd1d5a5362555106ee9e89f6705990398a3c69f8683bb18d67a", "ja": "え、ええっ！？\n迫力……わ、私に、ですか……？", "zh": "咦、咦咦！？\n气势……你、你说我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1008_p", "source_sha256": "81c535f78784920d927b568eb673eaf78c0e99c8d49054831b13a2ec3d82935b", "ja": "そうだな。迫力というか、気合いというか……\n詩花っていう、ライバルがいたからなのかな？", "zh": "对啊，该说是气势还是干劲……\n或许是因为你有诗花这个竞争对手吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "02b9a33ca26b01444f959692e768547ce67beef1f04024c559b6b3b639087bed", "ja": "あっ……も、もしかしたら、そうかもしれません……。\n私、詩花さんとお話をしたんですけど……。", "zh": "啊……说、说不定真的是这样……\n我跟诗花有稍微聊了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "67cb3b08c52a29b0d0b459f10725dad13b5ae00e0472150a51b6f3de524228ff", "ja": "少しだけ……ご、ご家族のこと、聞いたんです。\nお父さんに、気持ちをわかってもらえないって……。", "zh": "听了一些……有、有关她家人的事情。\n她的父亲，好像不能谅解她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d7c0b0f163960fb86cafbb7d8f957b7f691fc1e4c876b8f66806720e34ee675b", "ja": "へえ？　そうなのか……。", "zh": "咦？这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "c0aa8364e9533df659032a7cdbbf3288600876ca6f943abec9fd4191a6b2f7f8", "ja": "それを聞いて……私も、頑張りたいって思ったんです。\nわ、私の両親は、すごく心配性なんですけど……。", "zh": "听到这番话……我就觉得自己也要加油。\n我、我的父母虽然很爱替我操心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "f6b63331e4874edfda7eb2a6e34dd0f43c62ad128014d9f72fbfb1b36da88dd1", "ja": "でも……わ、私の気持ちも……\nわかって、ほしいから……。", "zh": "但是……我、我也希望……\n他们能明白我的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "baf3ebf804e365df720070c7ad8f8961f2dd389eadfe4243c06bba0b05b1d111", "ja": "アイドルとして、ちゃんとしてる姿を見せたい、\nなんて……。な、生意気ですよね、私なんかが……。", "zh": "我想让他们看到自己身为偶像独当一面的样子，\n说笑的……这、这样太狂妄了吧，我居然敢这样想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d814dba5d36d1d965fd6b064ec741b35b24b9072b7ae66c5fb26f40e83a3eb96", "ja": "そんなことないよ。可憐はアイドルとして、\nちゃんと頑張っていた。本当だ。", "zh": "没有这回事。\n可怜一直有在努力当个偶像，这是真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "046f438bd1f1c99ef31c8f5e946ae6978d51fbdd6113d7b895de6800981943e2", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nそ、そう言ってもらえて、ホッとしました……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n能、能听到你这么说，真让我松了口气……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "ca4b1745fb765254cba666a421cbd406c5d884cc62351df823083a2938cdf018", "ja": "{$P$}さんって、頼りがいがあって\n……なんだか、お、お父さんみたいですね……てへへ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生真是可靠……\n感觉就像我的爸、爸爸一样……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0073_1018_p", "source_sha256": "02d1056e5faf937399524e667afeadc9afb3758d22dd9d4b87a4793383fffae2", "ja": "（えっ！？　そんなに老けて見え……いや。\n親しみを感じてくれたんだと考えよう……うん）", "zh": "（咦！？我看起来有这么老……算了，\n就当她是觉得我很亲切吧……嗯。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
